App containers had no restart backoff — they restarted every 10s if not running, flooding logs (snake-game). Added restart_count + last_attempt_at columns to apps table (migration V20). Reconciler now uses the same should_attempt() exponential backoff that agents use (10s, 20s, 40s... capped at 5min). Reset restart_count to 0 when container is found running. Also added a 1s retry in the app proxy for the 'Container port not available' race condition that happens when Docker hasn't assigned the ephemeral host port yet after a restart.
